      "description": "Russian Verbs is your most complete and comprehensive reference to verb conjugations of the Russian language.\n\nFeatures:\n\nSearch by verb form or definition\n• English, Russian & Latvian user interfaces & verb definitions\n• Highlighted verb endings\n• Top 100, reflexive and verbs of motion lists\n• Stress marks help with pronunciation of verb forms\n• Share with others or create your favourites\n• Optimised for iPhone, iPod touch and iPad\n• Full support for dark and light modes\n• No Internet connection required\n\nGrammar:\n\n• Indicative, subjunctive and imperative moods\n• Imperfective and perfective aspects\n• Singular & plural persons\n• Reflexive verbs\n• Verbs of motion\n• Irregular verbs",
